Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw this weird vending machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Vending machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just sitting out\Nat a shut-down love hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never seen that brand before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing was on so I tried putting\Nsome money in, but it came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"Weekly Training Schedule"\N"Win the National Tournament"\NAnd it had this weird logo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And it had this weird logo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, first-years!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear? Hikawa isn't going\Nto qualify for the national tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. Didn't she get accepted\Ninto this school as an athlete?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for finding one of my precious coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get set!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so light! So strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With these legs, I can go anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little punks can't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Where are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't find a single one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Shuichi. Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've never seen it. Is it a coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be related\Nto you monsters somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"You monsters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only planning\Nto steal the coin from you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing my face is a problem.\NI guess I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Excuse me.\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, do it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Get rid of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you running away for! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot. Why'd you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She was defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How'd you know she was an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know if she was a monster or a thief,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but if someone shows up barefoot\Non your balcony, they're an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean!\NYou had the pepper spray ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew something might happen, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:06:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking about the coin, too!\NSomething about power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked to me like you\Nwere about to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that coin? Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a bigger problem.\NThat girl wants to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw her face.\NShe'll probably come to silence us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't like it either, having\Nsomeone else know you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl seemed used to this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only has she seen our faces,\Nshe knows where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but killing her...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it a prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I can say is that given the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it's up to the two of us\Nto do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a zipper on your back, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what am I? This is really--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shuichi. This coin means something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the form you take means something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This form's... meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You should find out what's\Ninside the zipper, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With that coin, "in exchange\Nfor power, you lose everything."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Something unknown to you--your true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My true power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's absurd?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to have that silly\Nform for absolutely no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Do I really have\Nsome kind of great power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? I'm going to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It must mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. There's nothing in there.\NNot even a sign of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Forget it, that girl is--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't care!\N--Forget it, that girl is--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't care!\N--What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something\Nabout her, we'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A costume... So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, do you mind if I go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth giving it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter the emptiness, and become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be what the emptiness means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. I feel like this will make us one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get digested\Nor something, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so sticky and moist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, be gentle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax. Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going all the way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so warm and fits just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No. You... You're inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. We are one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And... I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hatred...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sadness...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it! I feel your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you? Something terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, just calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense your feelings, too.\NAnger, anxiety...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you haven't yet realized how strong you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use that strength. How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's defeat her, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of chasing you shitheads!\NWhere's the bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fuck with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, you little shit?\NWhere's the bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.75,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?! Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle moving. You focus\Non channeling your strength to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to controlling you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You little shit!\NTrying to pull me down with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Run off and play with the other babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so weak! You little insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to die, little shit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Clair...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've got the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had trouble at first, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Like a glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The ugly sensation of hitting someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't stop Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Agency over my body\Nhad been taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're tough, shithead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you again. And if you\Ndon't answer, I'll snap your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you use the coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you give it to someone?\NOr take it somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to answer you, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably should have\Nbeen nice and answered, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No. This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can run. I can still run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm not quite ready to die, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a bad dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The absolute worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. Hey, so actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.25,0:16:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...I kind of pissed myself\Nwhile I was inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A week has passed since that night.\NAnd my routine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day I go to school like always,\Nchat with my friends like always...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.45,0:16:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Clair"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Clair"\NShe's in my contacts? When did she do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, did you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I just don't recognize\Nthe number. It surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to come to my classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fact that nothing\Nhas happened in the past week
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,means that nobody found out who we are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a crazy experience, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When I went inside you...\NThe sensation of melding with the costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The power rising up inside...\NThe incredible sense of smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain of being hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And sensing your feelings\Nas though they were mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt absolutely amazing! How was it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother you?! You killed someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed her. It's not\Nyour responsibility at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it was a legitimate act of self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:18:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. I don't want anything\Nto do with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to reveal my identity, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll tell people what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you fight? All by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be more of you. More monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do if another one comes after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you defend yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. If she hadn't been there,\NI would have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it. You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't defeat a monster\Nlike that with my skinny little arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the two of us join forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...we can take on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared. I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I got like this\Nor what's going to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:19:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is some kind of illness,\Ncould I just drop dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I transform and can't go back?\NHow will I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know. You're terrified of transforming,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but you still saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth,\NI don't know why you transform
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,or whether or not this coin is involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena... Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I can't guarantee you won't die
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or keep what you fear from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And things will probably\Nonly get worse from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why there's one thing I will promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But if something happens to you,\NI'll die with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if you die, you won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We two are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I say I want to die now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi... I'll be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. So close to letting it all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:21:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth,\NI'm looking for my older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short--she's a monster, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this for me, Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared.\NAfter killing my mother and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister's crime, these monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This town is a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We were brought together by destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hotel Mythos"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hotel Mythos"\N"Half a year earlier"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me find my coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As thanks, I will grant any wish you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can I use my wish on someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:22:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hmm... I think I can handle that,\Nbut are you sure it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing your wish on someone else like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone I want to be with!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.41,0:23:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 3: Elena"
